# Web E-Commerce Satu File (Python Flask)

Simpan sebagai **app.py** lalu jalankan di VSCode.

```python
from flask import Flask, render_template_string, request, redirect, url_for

app = Flask(__name__)

products = [
    {'id': 1, 'name': 'Laptop Gaming', 'price': 8500000},
    {'id': 2, 'name': 'Mouse RGB', 'price': 150000},
    {'id': 3, 'name': 'Keyboard Mechanical', 'price': 450000},
]
cart = []

HTML = '''
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>E-Commerce</title>
<style>
body{font-family:Arial;background:#f5f5f5;margin:20px}
.card{background:white;padding:15px;margin:10px;border-radius:10px}
a,button{padding:8px 12px;background:#007bff;color:white;text-decoration:none;border:none;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer}
</style>
<script>
function pesan(){ alert('Selamat berbelanja!'); }
</script>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Toko Online</h1>
<a href="/">Home</a>
<a href="/cart">Keranjang</a>
<hr>
{{content|safe}}
</body>
</html>
'''

@app.route('/')
def home():
    content = '<h2>Daftar Produk</h2>'
    for p in products:
        content += f"<div class='card'><h3>{p['name']}</h3><p>Rp {p['price']}</p><a href='/add/{p['id']}'>Tambah</a></div>"
    return render_template_string(HTML, content=content)

@app.route('/add/<int:id>')
def add(id):
    for p in products:
        if p['id'] == id:
            cart.append(p)
    return redirect(url_for('home'))

@app.route('/cart')
def lihat_cart():
    total = sum(i['price'] for i in cart)
    content = '<h2>Keranjang</h2>'
    for i in cart:
        content += f"<div class='card'><h3>{i['name']}</h3><p>Rp {i['price']}</p></div>"
    content += f"<h3>Total: Rp {total}</h3><a href='/clear'>Kosongkan</a> <button onclick='pesan()'>Checkout</button>"
    return render_template_string(HTML, content=content)

@app.route('/clear')
def clear():
    cart.clear()
    return redirect(url_for('cart'))

if __name__ == '__main__':
    app.run(debug=True)
```

## Cara Menjalankan

```bash
pip install flask
python app.py
```

Buka browser: [http://127.0.0.1:5000](http://127.0.0.1:5000)
